      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ff72b145687390cc441d687|full_name}: Yes, but the avatar preview shows the avatar with safety settings off as well. This is more of a request to be able to view your own avatars under various safety setting scenarios such as, animations or shaders disabled.",
